{"id":"n78203-1-10","stage":3,"title":"차비 · 车费","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78203-1-10-1","ko":"지수야, 나 집에 가야 하는데 차비가 없어. 돈 좀 빌려줘.","zh":"智秀啊，我得回家了，可是没有车费。能借我点钱吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"가야","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"차비가","meaning":"车费","explanation":"차비：车费；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차비","audio":"/audio/2babb12b537b650ae7ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78203","senseId":"1","lemma":"차비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차비가","audio":"/audio/a84305c8787349c26324.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"不足","explanation":"없다：不足；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"5","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려줘.","meaning":"借；表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"빌리다：借；주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"},{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"1","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려줘","audio":"/audio/8d9822f9ca28ee5637e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"2babb12b537b650a","term":"차비","zh":"车费","audio":"/audio/2babb12b537b650ae7ac.mp3","entryId":"78203","definition":"乘坐公交车、火车或出租车等车辆时出的钱。","pronunciation":["차비"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不足","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"钱财等不充分而穷。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"购物或做某事时所需的钱财。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"7cc8358d972a7f69","term":"빌리다","zh":"借","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3","entryId":"17824","definition":"一定时间内使用别人的东西或钱等，并约定事后还回或支付代价。","pronunciation":["빌리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c56cc6ad8c3045105f35.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78203-1-10-2","ko":"나도 내 차비밖에 없어.","zh":"我也只有自己的车费而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"“나의(我的)”的缩略。","explanation":"내：“나의(我的)”的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84426","senseId":"1","lemma":"내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b7